5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should start by asking what actually worked. I want to look into the post-occupancy review ratings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. I want to examine the timetable records on rooms out of service to see the disruption costs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I’d like to check the staffing posts since the hiring freeze. We need to know who is left to maintain whatever we build.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to review the weather days in the site diaries. We need to understand how much time we actually lose to external conditions.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll examine the tender records over three budget cycles. We need to see if the paper figures still match the market reality.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I also want to look into the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I’ll also review the booking data for specialist and general rooms. We need to know if the space is actually used.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I’ll also check the bench technicians' weekly manual routines. We need to see what daily labor is already being absorbed by the current setup.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll also review the survey findings in the older blocks. We need to know if hidden hazards will delay any ground-floor work.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll also examine the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier. We need to see if we’re funding replacements or just deferring the bill.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
