35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The staffing records are grim. Front-of-house posts remain unfilled, yet our technicians still have spare hours.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""George"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**George**: The staffing records are grim. Front-of-house posts remain unfilled, yet our technicians still have spare hours.""}]}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The site diaries confirm six weeks lost to weather. We must factor that into any outdoor project timeline.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mizuki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Mizuki: The site diaries confirm six weeks lost to weather. We must factor that into any outdoor project timeline.""}]}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The tender data is damning. Mechanical plant costs have jumped twenty percent, while our paper budgets barely moved.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,And the technicians log hours on manual checks the old equipment can’t automate. We’re paying for labor that should be mechanical.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""George"",""self"":true,""raw"":""George: And the technicians log hours on manual checks the old equipment can’t automate. We’re paying for labor that should be mechanical.""}]}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,The survey findings are worse. Hazardous material behind partitions means any ground-floor work adds months before contractors even start.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mizuki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Mizuki: The survey findings are worse. Hazardous material behind partitions means any ground-floor work adds months before contractors even start.""}]}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"And the renewal reserve? It doesn’t exist. We’re deferring the bill, not funding it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"So we are asking the same tired hands to do more, with no new staff to help.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""George"",""self"":true,""raw"":""George: So we are asking the same tired hands to do more, with no new staff to help.""}]}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. We are approving capital projects that quietly bankrupt the operational budget.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Benjamin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Benjamin: Precisely. We are approving capital projects that quietly bankrupt the operational budget.""}]}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The post-occupancy data is clear. Projects succeed when anyone can book them, and fail when locked to one wing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: The post-occupancy data is clear. Projects succeed when anyone can book them, and fail when locked to one wing.""}]}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"The booking data confirms it. Specialist rooms sit idle, while general requests are turned away. We are building the wrong spaces.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I agree. We are building for ghosts while the living crowd waits.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,The delivery schedules show comfort-based projects slip a year. We cannot afford that delay with our current staffing gaps.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mizuki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Mizuki: The delivery schedules show comfort-based projects slip a year. We cannot afford that delay with our current staffing gaps.""}]}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,And the decade of schedules confirms it. Inspection-driven work lands on time; comfort-driven work slips. We must prioritize the former.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Benjamin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Benjamin: And the decade of schedules confirms it. Inspection-driven work lands on time; comfort-driven work slips. We must prioritize the former.""}]}"
